  "notes": "Year = year of birth (children born in France). Data read directly from INSEE's national file 'prenoms-2025-nat.csv' (https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/fichier/8595130/prenoms-2025-nat_csv.zip), 'Fichier des prénoms' edition published 16/07/2026 covering births 1900–2025; both 2025 and 2024 are taken from this same edition. The file contains every first name, only ranks 1–100 per sex are stored here, ordered by INSEE's own 'rang' variable, which INSEE computes from unrounded counts (published counts are rounded to the nearest 5; INSEE states that exact ties are ordered at random). INSEE writes names in capitals with accents (e.g. 'LÉO', 'RAPHAËL'); they are given here in normal capitalisation with the source's accents. INSEE counts each spelling separately and warns it cannot guarantee exact frequencies (some entries may reflect later changes of first name). The same rankings can be browsed in INSEE's interactive tool: https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3532172"
}